{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the most <strong>cozy</strong>, <strong>cute</strong> and <strong>relaxing</strong> plushie toy shop in <strong>Wickwood</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 year old Kaitlyn has just finished her studies and moved back to her small hometown to help her grandfather with the family plushie shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what she didn't know was that the shop is magical! Her family has been creating plushies for centuries with the help of magical shelving, and now it's Kaitlyn's responsibility to continue the legacy and keep the long hidden secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy relaxing plushie sorting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwind with <strong>fun</strong> and <strong>soothing puzzle</strong> gameplay \u2013 even though there is a challenge, you don't lose very often and there are <strong>no time limits</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610270/extras/d2523a55988459ad9206f391ae77c873.poster.avif?t=1772462194\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610270/extras/d2523a55988459ad9206f391ae77c873.webm?t=1772462194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610270/extras/d2523a55988459ad9206f391ae77c873.mp4?t=1772462194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience a heartfelt story where choices matter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story explores themes such as <strong>family, friendship, romance</strong> and<strong> belonging</strong>. Featuring a <strong>diverse </strong>cast of characters and a sprinkle of <strong>magic</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610270/extras/5f7b056fd79e9c81a53ddfdb6e142d17.poster.avif?t=1772462194\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610270/extras/5f7b056fd79e9c81a53ddfdb6e142d17.webm?t=1772462194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610270/extras/5f7b056fd79e9c81a53ddfdb6e142d17.mp4?t=1772462194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize your room</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time to <strong>decorate</strong> and <strong>cozify</strong> the shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610270/extras/a5bb9943754fc529b47ae708647651da.poster.avif?t=1772462194\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610270/extras/a5bb9943754fc529b47ae708647651da.webm?t=1772462194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610270/extras/a5bb9943754fc529b47ae708647651da.mp4?t=1772462194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear and simple puzzle gameplay\u00a0\ud83e\udde9</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A compelling story with a diverse cast of characters\u00a0\ud83e\uddcd\u200d\u2640\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying sorting mechanic (plushies go poof!)\u00a0\u2728</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bunch of cute plushies\u00a0\ud83e\uddf8</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy room for you to customize\u00a0\ud83c\udf3c</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple romance options\u00a0\u2764\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing soundtrack\u00a0\u266b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can pet the cat!\u00a0\ud83d\udc08</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3610270?t=1772462194","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610270/f9438a4b17fe986fd887cd5cc3e03e28baf6c25c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772462194","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610270/759a7daf17417570df70e86cdc9a80588a636007/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772462194","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610270/759a7daf17417570df70e86cdc9a80588a636007/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772462194","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3933140,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the most <strong>cozy</strong>, <strong>cute</strong> and <strong>relaxing</strong> plushie toy shop in <strong>Wickwood</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 year old Kaitlyn has just finished her studies and moved back to her small hometown to help her grandfather with the family plushie shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what she didn't know was that the shop is magical! Her family has been creating plushies for centuries with the help of magical shelving, and now it's Kaitlyn's responsibility to continue the legacy and keep the long hidden secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy relaxing plushie sorting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwind with <strong>fun</strong> and <strong>soothing puzzle</strong> gameplay \u2013 even though there is a challenge, you don't lose very often and there are <strong>no time limits</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610270/extras/d2523a55988459ad9206f391ae77c873.poster.avif?t=1772462194\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610270/extras/d2523a55988459ad9206f391ae77c873.webm?t=1772462194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610270/extras/d2523a55988459ad9206f391ae77c873.mp4?t=1772462194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience a heartfelt story where choices matter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story explores themes such as <strong>family, friendship, romance</strong> and<strong> belonging</strong>. Featuring a <strong>diverse </strong>cast of characters and a sprinkle of <strong>magic</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610270/extras/5f7b056fd79e9c81a53ddfdb6e142d17.poster.avif?t=1772462194\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610270/extras/5f7b056fd79e9c81a53ddfdb6e142d17.webm?t=1772462194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610270/extras/5f7b056fd79e9c81a53ddfdb6e142d17.mp4?t=1772462194\" type=\"video/m